{"source":"github","project_id":"plsmod","target":"tidymodels/plsmod","id":"pr/42","ref":42,"title":"updates for no-suggests checks","description":"Add a GH workflow that only directly installs \"hard\" dependencies, i.e. Depends, Imports, and LinkingTo dependencies. Notably, Suggests dependencies are never installed, with the exception of testthat, knitr, and rmarkdown. The cache is never used to avoid accidentally restoring a cache containing a suggested dependency.","published_at":"2024-10-16T12:29:04Z","updated_at":"2024-10-16T12:52:13Z","url":"https://github.com/tidymodels/plsmod/pull/42","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"topepo","merged_at":"2024-10-16T12:52:13Z","state":"MERGED"}}
